  "economy.todayLead": "Bimpimu ya nitu mpi ya ngabu ya lukaya ya LOADOUT ti bilangi ya ngabu (0.6.0) ke monisa mutindu ya kimpimu mpi ya kuyoka yina mbongo ke pesa.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Sambu mbongo na yo kele sambu na kufuta bo. Mbwa ke banda kimvimba kisalama na AI sambu yo lenda vanda ata fioti; sima bamudesine ya kufutama ke bakisa kisalu ya AI, ti nkumbu na bo.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Mono lenda bula na internet?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Yo kele ya kukanda ve?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Bifuta",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Ve tee sika. Mbwa ya bantu mingi na LAN na nsika mosi ke sala bubu (banda na 0.2.0); mbwa na internet me salama ve.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Prototype salamaka na moteri ya open-source ya Quake III Arena (GPL) mpi bwato ya Elite Dangerous vandaka kifwani na yo. Na kilumbu ya zole kode ya mbwa vandaka na BuB, moteri ya sika yina Claude Code sonikaka; bimvuka ya mbwa kwisaka banda na prototype mpi bo pesaka yo bankumbu ya sika. Version 0.3.0 pesaka bimvuka yonso 16 ya bwato binitu ya sika. Ntalu ya kulanda nsiku ya kusadila ke tala kana kode mosi kele kaka na kisina ya GPL mpi kana bifwani ya ntete ya bwato kele pene mingi ti kisina na yo. Ntalu ya kutala kode ti kisina ya prototype ya GPL na nzila ya masini salamaka na <0/>, mpi ntalu ya bantu ya mayele ya bima yina yo monaka ke kwenda ntwala. Kima yonso yina yo me bakaka na kisina ta sonikama diaka to ta soba. Tee ntalu me suka, beto ke tuba ve ni fyoti ve.",
  "faq.questions": "Bifuta",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Bwato, bifwani, interface mpi yankaka, banda na mbongo ya kuvwanda. <0>Nkanda na lukaya yai<\/0> ke monisa kima yonso mpi ta monisa kubakisa yonso mpi mudesine na yo.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Bwato mpi bimpimu me yidikama sambu na kubakisama na kubula to kusumbama. Mutindu bwato ya kufutama ke vanda ya kimpwanza na mvita ya mutu na mutu me yindulama kaka tee sika.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Yai kele mpila: ya kukanda ve ti mbongo ya mbwa ya kuponama mpi bima ya kuyoka. Yo me salama ve tee sika.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Kisalu ya muntu mosi me kopiama?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Yo ke kwisa ntangu nki, mpi na nki?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Bitini nki bantu ta bakisa, mpi mono ta zaba nki?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Sambu na nki mbwa ya kisalama na AI ke sadisa bamudesine?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Yo ta vanda ya kufuta sambu na kuzwa?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Kilumbu ya kukwisa kele ve mpi ntalu ya mbongo kele ve tee sika.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude mpi Claude Code kele bimpusa ya Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine mpi Epic Games kele bimpusa ya Epic Games, Inc. Blender kele kimpusa ya Blender Foundation. Quake III Arena mpi Elite Dangerous kele bimpusa ya bamfumu na bo. Bankumbu yonso kele ya bamfumu na bo mpi bo ke sadilama kaka sambu na kuzaba bima yina bo ke tuba. Orion-81 kele ti kimvuka ve, kimpwanza ve to kuyamba ve ti kimosi na bo.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Ntalu ya kuzola kaka. Kimvuka, kimpwanza to kuyamba kele ve.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Kanale ke kwisa",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Devlog na YouTube",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Landa Kickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Bimvuka ya ntwala?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Bilandi ve. Cookie ve. Lukaya ya kutala. Kima yonso ke landa nkanda ya nsalu; kima mosi awa kele kupesa to kuvangana ve.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Me kuma ve",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Kima mosi me zibuka kaka: <0>ntalu ya nsiku ya kusadila<\/0> ya kode ya mbwa yina me kwisa na prototype ya GPL. Ntalu ya kutala kode ti kisina ya prototype na nzila ya masini salamaka na <1/>, mpi ntalu ya bantu ya mayele ya bima yina yo monaka ke kwenda ntwala.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 kele nsalu ya kisalama kimvimba na AI.<\/0> Kode ya Orion-81 mosi na Claude Code, na nzila ya mutungi; bwato, mapa, texture mpi mekolo me salama na bisalu yina Claude Code sonikaka. Biblioteke ya open-source yina yo ke sadila kele na kati ya <1>'Kisalama na AI ve'<\/1>.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Nsuka ya lukaya",
